{"version":1,"content":"<p>你花錢買了一台最新款的智能電視，為了保護私隱，你決定研究一下裏面的代碼。為了提高效率，你打開了 ChatGPT 輔助分析。結果第二天，<strong>你的 OpenAI 賬號被原地封禁，裏面充值的 500 美元餘額瞬間灰飛煙滅。</strong>理由是：你涉嫌<strong>「網絡濫用」</strong> 。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584968.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:46.817136+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:55:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_hash":"5c22b97f94a551d3e61012489a4f85d99126c85828bf27b712e956ab92f1c257","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}